WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.626 --> 00:00:01.418
They're making moves.

00:00:03.629 --> 00:00:04.796
Seems like everybody is.

00:00:06.173 --> 00:00:08.217
(alarm clock ringing)

00:00:08.217 --> 00:00:13.055
♪ Midtempo R&amp;B music ♪

00:00:13.055 --> 00:00:14.598
I wanted to make a difference.

00:00:14.598 --> 00:00:18.518
♪

00:00:18.518 --> 00:00:22.689
I'm all over this network. I need to have
a say in the future of this place.

00:00:22.689 --> 00:00:26.151
What you are asking is unprecedented.

00:00:27.069 --> 00:00:29.238
I am unprecedented.

00:00:29.238 --> 00:00:31.907
♪

00:00:31.907 --> 00:00:35.410
You want that seat at the grownup
table, but it's not your turn, Alex.

00:00:35.911 --> 00:00:37.496
Don't forget to shut the door on your way
out.

00:00:39.540 --> 00:00:40.540
Boop.

00:00:42.501 --> 00:00:44.628
Three, two, one...

00:00:45.212 --> 00:00:46.755
(overlapping chatter)

00:00:46.755 --> 00:00:48.173
♪ music intensifies ♪

00:00:48.173 --> 00:00:50.008
Bradley: We're off the air.
Alex: What's happening?

00:00:50.008 --> 00:00:51.260
Someone's in the system.

00:00:51.260 --> 00:00:53.387
Get that music turned off!

00:00:55.764 --> 00:00:58.600
UBA has been the target of a cyber
attack.

00:00:58.600 --> 00:01:01.019
This hack is nuclear.

00:01:01.019 --> 00:01:03.939
Certain things may come to light

00:01:03.939 --> 00:01:05.148
Did you ever tell anybody?

00:01:05.691 --> 00:01:09.319
Personal things that were never meant
to be shared.

00:01:09.319 --> 00:01:12.406
Let all the secrets come out!
They did not protect me.

00:01:12.406 --> 00:01:15.075
They didn't protect you... But I did.

00:01:15.075 --> 00:01:16.785
♪

00:01:16.785 --> 00:01:18.912
We are flirting with financial disaster.

00:01:20.289 --> 00:01:21.331
(screams)

00:01:21.331 --> 00:01:23.542
We need someone with more money than God!

00:01:23.542 --> 00:01:25.252
I am offering you a lifeline.

00:01:26.878 --> 00:01:28.005
Take the money.

00:01:28.005 --> 00:01:29.423
♪

00:01:29.423 --> 00:01:31.967
- How well do you know this guy?
- What does that mean?

00:01:31.967 --> 00:01:33.552
Do you know how much is at stake here?

00:01:33.552 --> 00:01:35.470
♪

00:01:35.470 --> 00:01:38.056
This is a chance to create something
better.

00:01:38.056 --> 00:01:39.725
But you have to really, really
want it.

00:01:40.350 --> 00:01:43.937
It's refreshing to get stabbed in the
stomach instead of the back, so thanks.

00:01:43.937 --> 00:01:45.981
♪

00:01:46.606 --> 00:01:49.359
Stella: He's making moves.
Corey: Seems like everybody is.

00:01:49.359 --> 00:01:52.404
♪

00:01:52.404 --> 00:01:54.197
What do you think Stella, you wanna run
this place?

00:01:54.197 --> 00:01:56.283
♪

00:01:56.283 --> 00:01:59.369
I know I made a huge mistake, but I am
handling it.

00:01:59.369 --> 00:02:01.913
Fix it or I will.

00:02:01.913 --> 00:02:06.585
You broke every rule! How do you sit in
that chair every night?

00:02:06.585 --> 00:02:09.504
♪

00:02:10.297 --> 00:02:13.884
It is time to smash and shatter.
Let's burn it all down.

00:02:15.927 --> 00:02:17.721
Alex: We should finish what we started.

00:02:17.721 --> 00:02:24.728
♪

